      "text": "(xviii) Upon receipt of an authorization for deduction of dues made out and filed in accordance with the rules and regulations set forth in this Order, the payroll office of the department or agency shall be given written notice to the employee of the filing or the authorization, the amount of dues to be deducted periodically, and the date on which such deductions will begin. A copy of this notice shall also be sent to the employee organization designated in the authorization.",
