      "text": "(xx) Upon written authorization of any employee organization participating in the payroll check-off employee organization dues, the OPA shall adjust the amount to be paid to the affected organization by an amount equal to that organization's cost allocation as a member of the Municipal Labor Committee, pursuant to Section 1174, subd. a, of the New York Charter and Article 7 of the Rules of the Municipal Labor Committee, adopted October 13, 1967, or as duly amended thereafter, and pay such amount directly to the Municipal Labor Committee set forth in the procedures of OPA.",
